cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FoldColabFlow in scholarly work, please cite the software using this metadata. The associated article citation will be added once it becomes available."
title: "FoldColabFlow"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "FoldColabFlow contributors"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  FoldColabFlow is an integrated Google Colab workflow for protein sequence
  quality control, comparative sequence analysis, physicochemical profiling,
  ColabFold-based structure prediction, structure validation, functional
  annotation, structural comparison, visualization, and reproducible export.
keywords:
  - bioinformatics
  - protein sequence analysis
  - protein structure prediction
  - ColabFold
  - AlphaFold
  - multiple sequence alignment
  - physicochemical descriptors
  - Google Colab
